nvestor portion may be allocated as described in this Prospectus.\n\nPAGE 5 \u2014 Objects and repeated contacts\nObjects of the Offer include capital expenditure and general corporate purposes.\nFace value and Offer Price will be determined through the Book Building Process.\n\nInvestors may contact Ananya Krishnan (same Contact Person as on page 1)\nat ananya.krishnan@ksh-sample.example or +91 22 4009 4400.\nThey may also write to Rohan Mehta at ksh.ipo@linkintime-sample.example.\n\nRegistered Office again: 12 MG Road, Bengaluru - 560001\nRegistrar again: Link Intime India Private Limited\n\nPAGE 6 \u2014 Declarations and signatures\nSigned by the Directors of our Company\n\nRajesh Kumar Sharma\nSneha Patel\nVikram Singh\n\nFor KSH International Limited\nMeera Iyer\nCompany Secretary and Compliance Officer\n\nPlace: Bengaluru\nDate: 15 January 2024\n\nSelling Shareholder: Acme Components Private Limited\nAuthorised Signatory: Arjun Desai\nEmail: arjun.desai@acme-sample.example\nPhone: +91 98765 43210\nAddress: Plot 19, MIDC, Pune - 411019\n",
